#. y1:english="Hehehe. {PA:10}Just as I thought.{PA:10}||You're stronger than you're rumoured to be.\nWhat the hell do you want?\nMy name is Kano.{PA:20}\nI came all the way to this city to make||a name for myself in the underworld.\nSo I have a favor to ask.\nWhat?\n...I want you to be my Aniki||and teach me the ins and outs of the Yakuza.\nThere is no better Aniki out there!{PA:10}||Come on, {PA:10}let me work under you, {PA:10}okay?\nGet someone else.\nI'm really sorry, {PA:10}but once I've made||a decision, there's no going back.\nFrom now on, I'm gonna work under you.{PA:10}||This has already been decided!\n\nI guess that's okay.\nThank you, {PA:10}Aniki!\nAlright then.{PA:10}||I'll go find us some business!\nI hope we make a lot of money!{PA:10}||See you!\n"
